WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is an AI voice. Full spoken text; the short captions are also burned into the video.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.650 line:78% align:center size:86%
This reads a shared inbox.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.400 line:78% align:center size:86%
These ten emails are invented.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:11.925 line:78% align:center size:86%
A real model, Gemini, reads each one and says what it is.

00:00:14.427 --> 00:00:19.777 line:78% align:center size:86%
Open one, and every detail it pulled out points to the sentence it came from.

00:00:20.027 --> 00:00:25.552 line:78% align:center size:86%
Anything it can't point to in the email is dropped by the code, not invented.

00:00:26.766 --> 00:00:30.316 line:78% align:center size:86%
Next, each sender is matched against the CRM.

00:00:30.566 --> 00:00:35.191 line:78% align:center size:86%
Then a plan is proposed, and the ones that need a person say so.

00:00:36.191 --> 00:00:39.966 line:78% align:center size:86%
Open a plan, and you see exactly what it will change.

00:00:40.216 --> 00:00:42.941 line:78% align:center size:86%
Approve it, and the records are written.

00:00:43.191 --> 00:00:45.666 line:78% align:center size:86%
The reply is held, never sent.

00:00:48.624 --> 00:00:55.449 line:78% align:center size:86%
An email that hides an instruction for the AI, or one that is unclear, is not acted on.

00:00:55.699 --> 00:00:58.374 line:78% align:center size:86%
It goes to a person, with the reason.

00:00:59.374 --> 00:01:04.049 line:78% align:center size:86%
Measured on one model, ten invented emails, and three runs.

00:01:04.299 --> 00:01:09.974 line:78% align:center size:86%
The mock passes everything. The real model passes two to four of ten cases.

00:01:10.224 --> 00:01:12.324 line:78% align:center size:86%
That gap is the finding.

00:01:13.324 --> 00:01:16.049 line:78% align:center size:86%
Anyone can try it, with no sign-in.

00:01:16.299 --> 00:01:22.374 line:78% align:center size:86%
It's a private sandbox that replays a recorded real run, and nothing is ever sent.
